---
import { Content, frontmatter } from '../../../drafts/yazelix-nova-v1.md';
import SiteHead from '../../components/SiteHead.astro';
import SiteNav from '../../components/SiteNav.astro';
import '../../styles/home.css';

const workspaceKeys =
	'https://github.com/Yazelix/nova/blob/da60dc7a855048edabe9706207d4f0721ed3c0a8/README.md#workspace-keys';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<SiteHead title={frontmatter.title} description={frontmatter.description} type="article" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="page-shell">
			<SiteNav active="blog" />
			<main id="main-content" class="section blog-article-page" tabindex="-1">
				<article class="blog-article">
					<header class="blog-article-header">
						<p class="eyebrow">{frontmatter.release}</p>
						<h1>{frontmatter.title}</h1>
						<p class="section-lede">{frontmatter.description}</p>
						<p class="article-meta">
							{frontmatter.authors} · {frontmatter.lastReviewed}
						</p>
					</header>
					<div class="blog-lead-strip strip">
						<figure class="blog-lead-media">
							<p class="media-take-label">Nova in under 60 seconds</p>
						<video
							autoplay
							muted
							loop
							playsinline
							controls
							preload="metadata"
							poster="/blog/yazelix-nova-v1/media/nova-in-60-seconds-poster.png"
							width="1784"
							height="996"
							aria-label="Nova in under 60 seconds: walk from Anima to the Nova tab, type a Codex ask, then files, a sliding tab, stacked panes, Carapace, Atuin, Ratconfig, Mandelbrot, and the agent's answer"
						>
							<source
								media="(prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)"
								src="/blog/yazelix-nova-v1/media/nova-in-60-seconds.mp4"
								type="video/mp4"
							/>
							<a href="/blog/yazelix-nova-v1/media/nova-in-60-seconds.mp4"
								>Watch Nova in under 60 seconds</a
							>
						</video>
						<figcaption>
							A 54-second pass through Nova. Press a time to jump. See the <a
								href={workspaceKeys}>workspace keys</a
							>.
						</figcaption>
						<ol class="video-timeline" aria-label="What happens in the video">
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="0" aria-label="Jump to 0:00"
									>0:00</button
								>
								<p>Anima is already a project tab: Yazi on the left, Helix on <code>boids.rs</code>.</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="1" aria-label="Jump to 0:01"
									>0:01</button
								>
								<p>Walk Starcompass, then Nova. Three projects, one keyboard.</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="3" aria-label="Jump to 0:03"
									>0:03</button
								>
								<p>
									On the Nova tab, Codex is asked what is special about Yazelix Nova for someone new.
								</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="12" aria-label="Jump to 0:12"
									>0:12</button
								>
								<p>
									Back in Anima, Alt r reveals the Helix file in Yazi and another file opens in the
									editor.
								</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="16" aria-label="Jump to 0:16"
									>0:16</button
								>
								<p>The Anima tab slides along the bar (3 → 2 → 1 → 2 → 3).</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="19" aria-label="Jump to 0:19"
									>0:19</button
								>
								<p>Stacked Nushell panes run commands, then a pane is moved in the stack.</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="28" aria-label="Jump to 0:28"
									>0:28</button
								>
								<p>
									Carapace completes <code>git switch</code>; Atuin searches this session's history.
								</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="35" aria-label="Jump to 0:35"
									>0:35</button
								>
								<p>Ratconfig jumps to Zellij and turns on rounded pane corners live.</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="45" aria-label="Jump to 0:45"
									>0:45</button
								>
								<p>Anima's Mandelbrot popup fills the workspace.</p>
							</li>
							<li>
								<button type="button" class="video-timeline-time" data-at="49" aria-label="Jump to 0:49"
									>0:49</button
								>
								<p>Codex answers on the Nova tab while the rest of the workspace stays put.</p>
							</li>
						</ol>
						</figure>
					</div>
					<div class="article-content">
						<Content />
					</div>
				</article>
			</main>
		</div>
		<script>
			const video = document.querySelector('.blog-lead-media video');
			const timeline = document.querySelector('.video-timeline');
			if (video instanceof HTMLVideoElement && timeline) {
				const buttons = [...timeline.querySelectorAll('[data-at]')];
				const markActive = () => {
					let active = buttons[0];
					for (const button of buttons) {
						if (Number(button.getAttribute('data-at')) <= video.currentTime + 0.05) active = button;
					}
					for (const button of buttons) {
						const on = button === active;
						button.toggleAttribute('aria-current', on);
						button.closest('li')?.classList.toggle('is-active', on);
					}
				};
				timeline.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
					const button = event.target instanceof Element ? event.target.closest('[data-at]') : null;
					if (!button) return;
					video.currentTime = Number(button.getAttribute('data-at'));
					void video.play();
					markActive();
				});
				video.addEventListener('timeupdate', markActive);
				markActive();
			}
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
